  "interpretation": "<ul data-start=\"1084\" data-end=\"1437\">\n<li data-start=\"1084\" data-end=\"1271\">\n<p data-start=\"1086\" data-end=\"1161\"><strong data-start=\"1086\" data-end=\"1098\">Positive</strong> for <strong data-start=\"1103\" data-end=\"1141\">IGH/CCND1 (t(11;14)) rearrangement</strong> is consistent with:</p>\n<ul data-start=\"1164\" data-end=\"1271\">\n<li data-start=\"1164\" data-end=\"1196\">\n<p data-start=\"1166\" data-end=\"1196\"><strong data-start=\"1166\" data-end=\"1196\">Mantle Cell Lymphoma (MCL)</strong></p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1199\" data-end=\"1271\">\n<p data-start=\"1201\" data-end=\"1271\"><strong data-start=\"1201\" data-end=\"1271\">Some Plasma Cell Dyscrasias (e.g., Multiple Myeloma with t(11;14))</strong></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1273\" data-end=\"1381\">\n<p data-start=\"1275\" data-end=\"1381\">This translocation results in overexpression of <strong data-start=\"1323\" data-end=\"1336\">Cyclin D1</strong>, playing a role in cell cycle dysregulation.</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1383\" data-end=\"1437\">\n<p data-start=\"1385\" data-end=\"1437\">Clinical and morphological correlation is essential.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>",
